generateSendSampleInvoice=Erstellen, senden und abrufen Sie eine Musterrechnung
EINVOICING_PROFILE=Wählen Sie das Exchange-Profil aus.
EINVOICING_PROFILE_HELP=Die verfügbaren Profile sind hier aufgelistet.
EINVOICING_USE_CHORUS=Chorus-Unterstützung aktivieren
EINVOICING_USE_CHORUS_HELP=If you work with the public sector, this shows the extrafields dedicated to Chorus Pro invoicing (service code, market number, commitment number) and sends them where the B2G rules of XP Z12-012 read them. It also raises the XML profile to EXTENDED-CTC-FR, the only one that carries the two buyer identifiers a public buyer needs (BR-FR-CPRO-10 and BR-FR-CPRO-11). Not all the B2G rules are covered yet.
